Opt-in Wine 11 support for Apple's published non-native PE-region API.

Original Caskrun adaptation of public API contracts in Apple's LGPL-2.1-or-later
Homebrew formula, revision 2bc44284e24d39ed64d6f492a0e1f4c47a5ced08,
Formula/game-porting-toolkit.rb. No CrossOver source is imported. The official
formula uses the same bool query and void(start,end) registration exports;
it provides no unregister contract and retains its library for process lifetime.

Append an owned Unix-call entry without changing existing indices. Only x64
application (non-builtin) PE mappings are registered, after import resolution
and before entrypoints can execute. Preload/query happens during native startup,
before PE ntdll initialization. This patch does not alter GS/TSD switching,
signal handlers, private Apple objects, code bytes, or security settings.

Off by default; requires an absolute independently validated local library path
in CASKRUN_D3DMETAL_SHARED_LIBRARY. Not an accepted graphics capability until
independent factory/device/render/lifecycle probes pass. LGPL-2.1-or-later.

